{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"鬼は外！福は内！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんこと北野日奈子です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年恵方巻きを食べる時に方角を向いて無口で食べ終わらなきゃいけないのを、家族みんなで仕掛けあって、結局最後はみんなでお兄ちゃんをはめようと、いたずらするのが節分の夜です！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんにいたずらしたくて、お兄ちゃんの携帯に電話をかけて知らん顔したこともあったな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の家は豆まきではなくお菓子まきをします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんお豆さんもまくんだけど、小袋にはいってるやつをまきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆まきの中心は飴やグミなど小袋のお菓子をまいて、鬼に向かってまいたのをすぐさま自分で回収しにいくんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってまいてるのは、おかしだもん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取られまいと必死にまいて必死にとりにいく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局は全部回収してお母さんが、みんなの分を平等に分けるんだけどね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴下の中にばれないように隠したことも何度かあります！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！ブログで白状したから許してもらおう！！！(๑¯ω¯๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私は毎日がおーがおーやってるから、今年は鬼役かな？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画像明るくしたり加工したらへんな色になっちゃった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの鬼役になってやる～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かかってこーい(๑¯﹀¯๑)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうやったらひなたぼっこになれますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→何もしなくても入れますよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にひなたぼっこしよ(*¯︶¯*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の選抜で出てみたい番組はある？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→うーん、なんだろう！贅沢すぎて思いつかないな:(´◦ω◦｀):"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな色って何色？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→好きな色か！サイリウムは黄緑とピンクを一緒に持っていてくれるとわかります！普段はあまり色は偏らないよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の携帯ケースは青色！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなたぼっこ入れてくださーい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→いーいでーすよー(*ﾟ▽ﾟ)ﾉ一緒にしましょ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんから見てせいたんはどんな一期生ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→畠中さんは、とっても優しくて可愛くて面白くて尊敬している先輩です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくメンバー思いなのも2期の私から見ても伝わってきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスの細い部分もいつも教えて下さりとても頼れる大好きな先輩(*˘︶˘*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段は恥ずかしくて畠中さんに話しかけられないんだけど、この間写真をとってもらえたんです♡うれしかった(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サインを書く機会が増えてきてると思うのですが、書き慣れましたか⁉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→全然書き慣れないです。毎回毎回ペンを持つと手が震えちゃう！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さささっとかっこ良く綺麗に書けるようになりたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃん の髪型を参考にしたいんだけど長さはどの位なんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→今は伸ばしてるっていうか切りにいってないっていうか、ボブはボブのままにするんだけど、どの長さのボブにするか迷走しています(；-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに切った時から今の長さまで毛先を3センチほど切っただけでそれ以外は切ってないです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1期生と2期生全員コメントしてるんだけどこれってすごいのカナ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→すごいと思います！コメントいつもありがとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうして未央奈にそんなＳなのー?\n聞かせて！(*´∀`)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→未央奈も私にはSだからかな！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈も私もお互いにバカにし合っているので、負けじといじりたくなる！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/03/3514770/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんは普段どんなお洋服着ていますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→家にいる時はずーっと寝巻きでいます！家の周辺にお買い物行ったりチップのお散歩の時はラフ系なのがおおい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決まってこういうの！って感じはないんだけど、ゴスロリ系とかは着たことないです！綺麗目な物からパーカーまで幅広く着ています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},